{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LootMage</strong> is a bullet-hell action roguelite game set in a medieval fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an adventurer in this realm, you must brave ever-changing dungeons, battle fierce enemies, collect treasures, and fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/ENSOGE_BulletHell.png?t=1741063115\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/SteamStore_1.gif?t=1741063115\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge relentless waves of enemy attacks and experience thrilling combat with powerful magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're defeated, you'll lose all your items,but the skills and knowledge you've gained will carry over to your next challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be able to reach the end of the dungeon?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/ENSOGE_Item.png?t=1741063115\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/SteamStore_2.gif?t=1741063115\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This world is brimming with magic staves, heavy swords, magic orbs, and all sorts of other weapons and items.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What you find in the dungeon and how you combine them to continue your journey depends on your luck and choices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/ENSOGE_Insignia.png?t=1741063115\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/ProjectileCustom.gif?t=1741063115\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Passive items come with two unique engravings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect items with the same engravings to activate powerful synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some engravings provide overwhelming power but demand a heavy price in return.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/ENSOGE_Custom.png?t=1741063115\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player's Mystic Gauntlet can be customized using Mana Stones obtained during dungeon exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine various projectile options to create your own combat style!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/ENSOGE_Dungeon.png?t=1741063115\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/SteamStore_3.gif?t=1741063115\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore procedurally generated dungeons that present new challenges each time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observe enemy patterns and adapt to shifting terrain as you grow stronger with every attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When will you finally master the art of surviving these treacherous depths?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;The dungeons of <strong>LootMage</strong> always hold new treasures and challenges awaiting your discovery.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/Test.png?t=1741063115\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3300760?t=1741063115","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741063115","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/3c078fa1a07531f039dd1ffe0bdea12131efea45/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741063115","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/3c078fa1a07531f039dd1ffe0bdea12131efea45/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741063115","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3435090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LootMage</strong> is a bullet-hell action roguelite game set in a medieval fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an adventurer in this realm, you must brave ever-changing dungeons, battle fierce enemies, collect treasures, and fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/ENSOGE_BulletHell.png?t=1741063115\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/SteamStore_1.gif?t=1741063115\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=