paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/ENSOGE_Custom.png?t=1741063115\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player's Mystic Gauntlet can be customized using Mana Stones obtained during dungeon exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine various projectile options to create your own combat style!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/ENSOGE_Dungeon.png?t=1741063115\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/SteamStore_3.gif?t=1741063115\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore procedurally generated dungeons that present new challenges each time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observe enemy patterns and adapt to shifting terrain as you grow stronger with every attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When will you finally master the art of surviving these treacherous depths?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;The dungeons of <strong>LootMage</strong> always hold new treasures and challenges awaiting your discovery.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/Test.png?t=1741063115\" /></p>","developers":["CurlyMango"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/header.jpg?t=1741063115","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requiremen